        "GIP/GLP-1双受体激动剂"@zh ;
    skos:scopeNote "Placed under GLP-1 receptor agonists by project decision (2026-10-14), as most market analyses do. ATC classifies tirzepatide under A10BX (other blood glucose lowering drugs), so there is no exactMatch to an ATC class."@en .

